    "Condition : 1 - \r\nThe proposed use of part of ground floor shop unit as mini cab office would not be acceptable as it would increase the demand for on-street parking, and therefore interfere with the free flow of traffic along The Crossways. The proposal would cause detriment to both pedestrian and highway safety contrary to Policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development), T.1.4 (Car and Cycle Parking and Servicing Facilities for Developments),  T.4.3  (Traffic Implications of New Development) and T.4.4 (Road Safety) of the Unitary Development Plan. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"
